# Board-specific iCE40 pin constraint template for the AD1856 formatter.
#
# Copy this file to a board-specific .pcf and replace every <PIN> with the
# exact FPGA package pin from that board's schematic. Do not wire this to the
# SAME70 or AD1856 until the selected board is confirmed to use 3.3 V I/O.

# External low-jitter XO input, 11.2896 MHz for the first 44.1 kHz test.
# set_io clk_xo <PIN>

# Optional external reset. Tie high through a 3.3 V-safe pull-up if unused.
# set_io reset_n <PIN>

# SAME70 slave-TX side.
# set_io same_td <PIN>
# set_io same_tk <PIN>
# set_io same_tf <PIN>

# AD1856 serial control side.
# set_io ad1856_data <PIN>
# set_io ad1856_clk <PIN>
# set_io ad1856_le <PIN>
